      "comment": [
        "Play the Globe Arena. Dance style music is what really attract the big crowds to this venue.",
        "Unless you're into musicals, dance music is the dish of the day in this metropole.",
        "The Muscovites like both kinds: heavy AND metal.",
        "The band will play the enormous Haga Sofia mosque. It holds thousands of pop-loving turks.",
        "Metal bands go to Japan when their careers dry out elsewhere. Punkrockers might wanna give it a try too.",
        "Once the mecca of metal, LA still loves those hair bands. Plain ole rock goes down nicely, too.",
        "Bright lights, big city. The capital of the world caters to any taste, but if you must choose punk and pop are most important.",
        "Brazil has got plenty of rhythm of its own, but they might appreciate some foreign dance music and metal.",
        "Outdoor gig, on a rock by the water where the oceans meet. Do you really think the music matters much in a setting like that?",
        "Sydney is full of bars and small venues and its people like all kinds of music. You'll be set to do a gig in the olympic arena, but these guys like most types of tunes.",
        "A business and culture centre which attracts all kinds of people. Pop music seems to be the most popular type.",
        "These guys are all into grinding punk rock.",
        "Once a divided city, Berlin now focuses all its attention on punk rock.",
        "Paris is the epicentre of European pop, preferably nice bubbly songs emphasizing beauty rather than power.",
        "This place is all about romantic love songs. It must be elegant so pop is the only genre that is really appreciated by the Romans.",
        "Nothing is as big with Czechs as metal. The heavier the better.",
        "Maple leafs aside, rock is the order of the day in this beautiful city.",
        "These Canadians are really into soda. And pop.",
        "The fastest growing city in the world appreciates the fastest grooving pop music on offer.",
        "If it ain't metal, it ain't worth the plastic its pressed on.",
        "Pop goes the weasle. Get the picture?",
        "Nine hundred million Indians can't be wrong: classic pop, chart romping hits crossing the caste divide rule.",
        "Once the Gibraltar of Asia, Hong Kong has its own rock. Except theirs is musical rather than mineral.",
        "Do a gig in The Forbidden City! The irony of ear-blasting pop music in a place where speech was once banned.",
        "Norway is not all about fjords and knitted sweaters, it's also a place of great musical taste and what the Norwegians like most is pop purer than the water they drink.",
        "Precious metal is what this place is all about. The more and the heavier, the better.",
        "Copenhagen's Christiania, where your concert will be held, is famous for two things: anarchist lifestyle and bad ass rock.",
        "Giant football stadium Amsterdam Arena will be the setting for this gig. Remember, though, the football fans only want groovy rock.",
        "Always a great cultural influence on the world, the Spanish have made their minds up on music and the fact is that pop music is the only thing that counts. ",
        "Home of Rock'n'Roll"
      ],
